   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) le renforcement de la r&#xe9;ponse aux incidents CBRN des organisations civiles et militaires lors d&#x2019;&#xe9;v&#xe9;nements et d&#x2019;incidents CBRN dans la r&#xe9;gion de l&#x2019;ANASE; 2) le renforcement des pratiques de r&#xe9;ponse aux incidents CBRN des &#xc9;tats membres de l&#x2019;ANASE.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) strengthened the CBRN incident response of civilian and military organizations during CBRN events and incidents in the ASEAN region; and (2) enhancing the CBRN incident response practices of ASEAN member states.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
